<doctext field_name="doctext">&lt;p&gt;Hi [Argel],&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;In your situation (users are not programmers), I'd say it's easier to teach people to use parentheses everywhere than to teach them the operator precedence table, especially across multiple languages. If you use parens everywhere, it doesn't matter whether you use high- or low-precedence ops.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Hope this helps,&lt;br&gt;-- Hauke D&lt;/p&gt;</doctext>
